## Performance Benchmark (1,000 rows)

This benchmark measures the performance impact of using CRDT metadata synchronization on database operations.

> ❌ Baseline time is greater than CRDT time. This is likely due to running with a very low number of rows (1,000). This is not  a valid benchmark and the time comparison should be ignored.
  - SELECT: 12.93 ms > 12.09 ms
